{"name": "Deus Exia", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cO dweller of another world, you have opened the seal of the Exiles. They are fiercely aggressive, we had no choice but to banish them. Before your planet gets blown into smithereens, take this sword and protect yourself.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After \u2018accidentally\u2019 breaking a dangerous seal, Exia is entrusted with the Sword of Deus, a powerful extraterrestrial weapon. Now she must fend off an impending alien invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wreak destruction on your foes with ground combos, air combos and 50+ types of active skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"430\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/5867763f4c2ce20b2a5a767d37098da0.poster.avif?t=1791280838\" width=\"766\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/5867763f4c2ce20b2a5a767d37098da0.webm?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/5867763f4c2ce20b2a5a767d37098da0.mp4?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"430\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/c357508e8edafb7be3fb3f2016c9a02f.poster.avif?t=1791280838\" width=\"766\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/c357508e8edafb7be3fb3f2016c9a02f.webm?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/c357508e8edafb7be3fb3f2016c9a02f.mp4?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decide when to knock enemies down. Some enemies retaliate when getting back up, so look out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"430\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/fc4f1247454e7bc1bb98e334e25db971.poster.avif?t=1791280838\" width=\"766\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/fc4f1247454e7bc1bb98e334e25db971.webm?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/fc4f1247454e7bc1bb98e334e25db971.mp4?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your parry, use it to block melee attacks or reflect enemy projectiles back at them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"430\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/34117fe306439a024083979a9a2e48d4.poster.avif?t=1791280838\" width=\"766\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/34117fe306439a024083979a9a2e48d4.webm?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/34117fe306439a024083979a9a2e48d4.mp4?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen your abilities by collecting and upgrading 100+ types of cards scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey across four regions: Dravendale City, Eremoth Desert, Ulthar Tundra and Stelaria Isles, each featuring unique environments and new characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/392bf0fa4bc017c6708c032e28d720b8.avif?t=1791280838\" width=\"768\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face overwhelming threats: will you emerge victorious?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"430\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/71500dbf83d57f4042704e569098fc42.poster.avif?t=1791280838\" width=\"766\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/71500dbf83d57f4042704e569098fc42.webm?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/71500dbf83d57f4042704e569098fc42.mp4?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"430\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/c875faf5982c6cb9ae7a6a7787e87e4b.poster.avif?t=1791280838\" width=\"766\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/c875faf5982c6cb9ae7a6a7787e87e4b.webm?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/extras/c875faf5982c6cb9ae7a6a7787e87e4b.mp4?t=1791280838\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 2D pixel sidescrolling action platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 16+ levels, each introducing new environments, enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- An elaborate combo and knockdown system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 100+ cards to enhance your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 50+ active skills for handling different situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 60+ cutscene illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Available in English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese and Japanese.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "\u201cBefore your planet gets blown into smithereens, take this sword and protect yourself.\u201d Embark on a colorful 2D pixel action adventure in Deus Exia! Slash, parry and combo through four distinct lands. Collect cards and skills to craft powerful builds \u2014 then overcome deadly enemies and bosses.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602210/f5d28dedc1b437a315c4077771c335a7c9a719b2/header.jpg?t=1791280838", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Side Scroller", "Fantasy", "Action-Adventure", "Hack and Slash", "2D Platformer", "Action"], "developers": "Rune Game Dev", "publishers": "Rune Game Dev", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3602210", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 October 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/WU7pvNEPyOw", "first_seen": 1791237600.0, "review_rank": 14}